  If `opj` has shape `batch_shape_j + [M_j, N_j]`, then the combined operator
  has shape `broadcast_batch_shape + [sum M_j, sum N_j]`, where
  `broadcast_batch_shape` is the mutual broadcast of `batch_shape_j`,
